    <meta property="og:title" content="An optic to replace space and its application towards ultra-thin imaging systems - Nature Communications"/>
    <meta property="og:description" content="The need for space between lenses in optical systems results in a trade-off between potential for miniaturisation and achieved resolution. Here, the authors demonstrate a device that propagates light longer than its thickness, a spaceplate, and can therefore replace space in optical systems."/>
